What's up, drivers! 
CarX Street PC 1.0.7 update is already here!


What's new:

- Japanese localization added;
- Game pause removed from leaderboard races;
- Cost of the one-spot property in Mid-Town and Industrial areas reduced;
- Color of property spots changed;
- Yacht Club Estates property spots fixed;
- Player's icons size reduced on global map;
- New steering wheels, pedals and brakes are now supported.

Enjoy!

What's up, drivers! 
1.0.6 Update is already available! 

What's new: 

- New languages added: German and French;
- Increased rewards in Elite Races;
- Expanded account level range;
- Car models fixed: 30Z, S18, BX5, CHR, NX5 and NX5C, EV9, DX7, HSX, HS2;
- Gaps between the hub and the rim fixed.
- Removed camera shaking in photo mode;
- Pilot animations fixed;
- Class display in tuning fixed;

We would like to inform you that players who did not receive compensation for completing clubs before the economy update will receive it soon.

What's up, drivers! 

This topic here is created for the new tire model discussion.
We'd like to hear detailed all-around feedback from you on this new model, so please, feel free to share your thoughts and comments. 

Changelog: 

- New tire model;
- Improved car handling simulation;
- Drift and grip improvements;
- Enhanced steering wheel handling and force feedback;

Please note, that your progress made in this test version of the game won't be transferred to the main version!

To test the new physics, right-click on CarX Street in your Steam library, select "Properties" from the menu, then go to the "Betas" tab, and in the drop-down list at the top, find the "public_test" option.

What's up, drivers!
We've reviewed all your feedback on the game and have prepared a new version of car physics for CarX Street PC. We'd love to hear back from you on this!

What's new: 

New tire model;
Improved car handling simulation;
Drift and grip improvements;
Enhanced steering wheel handling and force feedback;

We are waiting for your feedback! 
You can use ⁠public-test channel to let us know your thoughts! 

Updated: Please note, that your progress made in this test version of the game won't be transferred to the main version!

To test the new physics, right-click on CarX Street in your Steam library, select "Properties" from the menu, then go to the "Betas" tab, and in the drop-down list at the top, find the "public_test" option.

What's up, drivers!
We are happy to inform you that the 1.0.3 update for CarX Street PC is now available!

✅ What's new: 

⚒ Rivals AI.
- Club races rivals' AI behavior improved;
- AI rivals' difficulty adjusted;

⚒ In-game balance:
- Reduced the cost of visual tuning parts;
- Removed the cost for reinstalling parts;
- Removed the cost from the dynostand, except for parameters that allow extra upgrade of the component;
- Increased rewards for completing clubs;
- Increased rewards for completing club races;
- Increased rewards for completing elite races;
- Increased rewards in delivery quests;
- Reduced cooldown timers for elite races;
- Increased experience gained from completing club races;
- Reduced the cost of Racing and Racing+ tires;
- Reduced the consumption of Stock fuel;

⚒Improvements:
- Added a window displaying the car class in the engine upgrade section of the dynostand;
- Expanded the range of volume adjustment for engine and tire sounds;
- Simplified the intro quest;
- Improved the display of the ideal trajectory and braking zones in races;
- Improved the English voiceover of the game;

⚒Bugfixes:
- Fixed a bug with icons on the global map;
- Fixed the behavior of smoke when cars move in a straight line;
- Improved the smoke system;
- Added IDLE animation for the car pilot;
- Fixed a bug with the driver’s hand.

❗Additionally, we'd like to point out that we are working on improving security of the game, and we are noticing all cases of cheating and modding in-game data. 

Have fun!

What's up drivers!
CarX Street PC 1.0.2 Update is already available for Steam players. 

 What's new: 

- Memory leak issue fixed;
- Free ride reward was increased;
- Fuel price reduced;
- Game stutters fixed.

Enjoy!

What's up drivers!
CarX Street PC 1.0.1 update is available now.

What's new: 
- Force Feedback Issue with Moza devices fixed; 
- H-Shifter issue fixed; 
- Axis calibration issue fixed; 
- Other adjustments. 

Thanks a lot for all your feedback.
